# mcp-fhir

MCP FHIR Server Implementation

A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that provides FHIR resource access and manipulation capabilities.

## Features
- FHIR resource CRUD operations
- MCP server implementation
- Healthcare data interoperability support
- Integration with FHIR servers

## Installation
```bash
npm install @flexpa/mcp-fhir
```

## Usage
```javascript
import { FhirMcpServer } from '@flexpa/mcp-fhir';

const server = new FhirMcpServer({
  fhirBaseUrl: 'https://your-fhir-server.example.com',
  // additional configuration
});

await server.start();
```

